mio
===

File:      src/mio.h
Upstream:  https://github.com/mandreyel/mio
Copyright: Copyright 2017 https://github.com/mandreyel
License:   MIT

The file is the single-header amalgamation of the 'mio' memory-mapping
library, added to this project in 2020. It differs slightly from the current
upstream file (in its Windows file-opening code, its exception guards, and
by defining NOMINMAX and NOGDI before including <windows.h>). All copyright
notices are retained.
